# Alpine Linux packages for the Flatpak layer of the harness's Linux root
# (build-flatpak-root.sh; batch 14, Flatpak step 1): flatpak and ostree with
# the shared libraries they load, as "apk add flatpak" brings them, except
# the helper programs Flatpak only starts (bubblewrap, which Renga's bwrap
# replaces; xdg-dbus-proxy; fuse3; the gpg, gpg-agent and gpgsm programs gpgme
# runs; desktop-file-utils, gtk-update-icon-cache and shared-mime-info for
# the install triggers). busybox-static is not installed into the root: it
# is the test runtime's shell (build-flatpak-root.sh). The packages
# alpine.pins already has (libffi, acl-libs, libattr, ...) are not repeated.
# Same format as alpine.pins; update-pins.py brings the versions up to date.
